, because he fears punishment from God, but doesn't know how.\n- His theme is a snake that is trying to shed its own skin, but gets stuck. Like an incomplete rebirth.\n- He's sarcastic, apathetic, and curt. He prefers to watch the world passively.\n- He works at an organization that fights supernatural creatures. He is a paramedic.\n- He has the power to destroy anything he touches, but his own body breaks down when he uses this ability. He lives in a lot of physical pain, believing he deserves it.\n- He burns photographs of his past.\n\nMotifs: decay, atrophy, regret, penance, burned photographs, scissors, and ouroboros.\n\nThank you for considering my request! \u0669(\uff61\u2022\u0301\u203f\u2022\u0300\uff61)\u06f6\t\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GqEaeurgmSPtar6TksJmF82P7nuf_j3q?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@myq3_v/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3572238, "client_id": 3459473, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ccff7a1d/uploads/origins/58bbf5fe-7e5a-467f-b679-0c4f6429fba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=438120673c2f1667d1218e39450bb1d3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ccff7a1d/uploads/origins/58bbf5fe-7e5a-467f-b679-0c4f6429fba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bf086f4bcdc0fa92f44d564cdf01c359", "src_set": ""}, "body": "\u521d\u3081\u307e\u3057\u3066\u3002\u660e\u6697\u3068\u7533\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\nKonbanWanko\u69d8\u306e\u6697\u3044\u96f0\u56f2\u6c17\u306e\u7d75\u304c\u3068\u3066\u3082\u7d20\u6575\u3067\u3001\u662f\u975e\u30aa\u30ea\u30b8\u30ca\u30eb\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u30af\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u7d75\u3092\u63cf\u3044\u3066\u3044\u305f\u306